refully. Every Fruit Plays by Different Rules.** Every fruit bends the rules in its own way, with unique physics and quirks that can turn a simple putt into a power move\u2026 If you can master it! \n{871299389056939}\n# HOW TO PLAY:\n\n# MULTIPLE HEADSETS\nGo head-to-head in VR! Online or in-person, take turns golfing and sabotaging.\n\n# ONE HEADSET HOTSEAT\nOne headset, many saboteurs! Friends join FREE on phones (www.fruitgolf.com) to wreak havoc.\n\n# SOLO PRACTICE\nHone your swing, conquer challenges, and enjoy the hilarious physics of Fruit Golf! \n{2057401171694269}**Unlock the Drip. Flex the Chaos.** Crush challenges, unlock ridiculous gear, and make sure everyone knows you did it first.\n{861375006303270}**Weaponized Nonsense.** Sabotage every move with floppy sharks, ectoplasm, portals, mouse traps and more! If it causes chaos, it\u2019s fair game.\n{3524926690977542}**Golf Course or Battle Arena?** Fight it out in wildly themed spaces; underwater, in orbit, on the kitchen counter, then stack the deck with obstacles and turn it into pure mayhem!", "short_description": "A Game Built on Sabotage! One headset, many saboteurs! Mobile friends join for FREE (www.fruitgolf.com) to add to the chaos.  \ud83d\udc0e**Special Lunar New Year Gifts available now! Join our Discord to claim your in-game rewards!**\ud83d\udc0e"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coal Car Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/contact-us", "website_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SOCIAL", 